This independent fork has been modified since 2026-10-11, including shared
Shizuku service lifecycle fixes and the Android native settings interface.
2026-10-13: updated maintainer information, project and feedback links,
upstream credits, and bundled license and corresponding-source entries.
2026-10-15: added Compose/Miuix home and navigation, direct GitHub feedback,
and on-demand stable-release update checks in About.
2026-10-16: renamed this fork to ReMRSS, migrated its application ID and
source namespace to top.zainzh.rearscreen, and isolated its update feed
from earlier MRSS installations; the automation URI scheme is retained.
2026-10-17: unified settings and service visuals, added independent permission
checks and an offline tutorial, and removed unused code, resources and
dependency metadata while retaining the existing feature set.

